<http://cmt#Paper> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Paper> .

<http://cmt#PaperAbstract> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Abstract> .

<http://cmt#Person> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Person> .

<http://cmt#ProgramCommittee> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Program_Committee> .

<http://cmt#ProgramCommitteeMember> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Program_Committee_member> .

<http://cmt#Review> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Review> .

<http://cmt#date> owl:equivalentProperty <http://sigkdd#Date> .

